-- Every theme is a two-colour gradient design:
--   bg -> bg2          window body (top to bottom)
--   header -> header2  sidebar (top to bottom)
--   accent -> accent2  the signature gradient (top line, toggles, sliders, buttons, headers) 
--   panel / field      groupbox body / inputs, buttons and dropdown boxes
